# One line ending in every working tree.
#
# The app-server schema bundle is a byte contract: `schema/app-server/**` is
# compared, string for string, against a bundle generated in memory — which
# always writes `\n`. A Windows checkout that translated the committed copy
# would drift on line endings alone, and CI said so. Nothing here is a shell
# script Windows needs `\r\n` for, so the rule is the repository's, not the
# bundle's.
* text=auto eol=lf
